{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4537, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 4264, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4542, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "fa80f293f35cf186f1b2f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "잘 부탁드려요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よろしく、//おねがいします！", "pointer_offset": 4268, "unit": "dialogue:2ce11e4fe4e7ce34", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5960, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f0bcf0d7f0b9f1d181432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번 시합에선，//제 패가//보너스 패예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//あたしのパイが//ボーナスパイですよ。", "pointer_offset": 4272, "unit": "dialogue:d60351e3a38f3d36", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4624, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f299f149f0b8f0cf81442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이것입니다．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこちらです。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 4276, "unit": "dialogue:b422d39d7a59a6f1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4695, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2caf7d12f2ff0dff944f5f3f0c7f0f0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "그럼…//제가 딜러네요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "では……//あたしが、親ですね。", "pointer_offset": 4280, "unit": "dialogue:03df9df132b3612e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4726, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0f081432f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f5f3f0c7f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "네，//오오가미 씨가 딜러예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい、//大神さんが親ですよ。", "pointer_offset": 4284, "unit": "dialogue:ee2772546ce5c4bd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4755, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f2cef4552f2ff0b2f3bbf15af0ef8144", "baseline_text": "후훗//이겼어요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふふっ//勝っちゃいました。", "pointer_offset": 4288, "unit": "dialogue:be7d109d68b73f6b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4782, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0aff7d12f2ff9d0f26cf35df0f0f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "하아…//져 버렸네요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はぁ……//負けちゃいましたか……", "pointer_offset": 4292, "unit": "dialogue:f54b6e947111b8e4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4815, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f957f0a4f8a4f287f0aff0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이번에는 지지 않아요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、負けませんよ！", "pointer_offset": 4296, "unit": "dialogue:c5b490d166c102ef", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4838, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f2cef1adf7d1f16bf2d5f293f0d3f144f0ef81482f2ff2d5f293f957f0b1f8a4f287f2e9f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff1c3f1c8f3d2f0a2f0b8f2618143f273f274f29ef25281b8", "baseline_text": "후우…무승부인가요？//승부는 나지 않았지만…//즐거웠으니까，괜찮겠죠∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふぅ……引き分けですか。//勝負はつきませんでしたけど……//楽しかったから、いいですよね！", "pointer_offset": 4300, "unit": "dialogue:1c5dc228b251f38e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4927, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f0e2f9f7f26af0e2f15781432f2ff0bef0a7f0aef0bef149f0b8f0cf81442f2ff3a8f194f0a5f984f154f15af0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다음 대전 상대는，//코쿠리코입니다．//응원하고 있어요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の対戦相手は、//コクリコです。//応援していますよ！", "pointer_offset": 4304, "unit": "dialogue:0935dbf6afa0a351", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 4980, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 4308, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5003, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2caf7d12f2ffa80f293f35cf186f1b2f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼…//잘 부탁드려요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それでは……//よろしく、おねがいします！", "pointer_offset": 4312, "unit": "dialogue:fbb4bfbeb59ca271", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5044, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0dcf0aef15a81432f2ff491f0a5f0d7f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "클리어，//축하합니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "クリアー、//おめでとうございまーす！", "pointer_offset": 4316, "unit": "dialogue:61e636574c02b17a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5081, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca81432f2ff27bf15cf14bf947f1c3fac6f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，//계속해서 즐겨 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "では、//続けてお楽しみください！", "pointer_offset": 4320, "unit": "dialogue:d088a9520ee26497", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5114, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca81432f2ff2b5f25af2a9f0d2f8e7f0bcf0edf0a5f29ef0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "그럼，//토너먼트를 시작하겠습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それでは、//勝ち抜き戦をはじめますね。", "pointer_offset": 4324, "unit": "dialogue:be3c155d0e838e76", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5153, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0b2f0dff293f0dd81432f2ff26af0e2fa57f0cffdbaf2aaf0f3f7d1", "baseline_text": "이제부터，//상대할 다섯 명은…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "これから、//お相手する５人は……", "pointer_offset": 4328, "unit": "dialogue:94467f1a7f83414a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5905, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e72f2ff2e4f0c7f557f0aef94ff279f94bf1d1f386f1fb81432f2ff1d1f8c5f5f9f26cf149f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨를//쓰러뜨리기 위해 선택된，//선발 멤버입니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんを//倒すために選ばれた、//選抜メンバーです！", "pointer_offset": 4332, "unit": "dialogue:73a31eb4cecb53cf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0019", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5239, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f484f19cf14781432f2ff3a1f261f8a4f0b2fac6f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "힘내서，//끝까지 이겨 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "がんばって、//勝ちぬいてくださいね！", "pointer_offset": 4336, "unit": "dialogue:acba5e5f0106134d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0020", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5276, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d12f2ff0cff8bcf9a9f24881432f2ff26af0e2f94bf1e2f0bcf29ef15af0ef8148", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…//다시 한 번，//상대해 주시겠어요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん……//もう一度、//お手合わせ願えますか？", "pointer_offset": 4340, "unit": "dialogue:83b238e71dc87e4a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0021", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5325, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0d8f143f148f25281b82f2ff0b2f248f0b9f8f4f0a4f8a4f287f8c8f1c8f26bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그래야죠∈//이번에도 지지 않을 거예요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうこなっくっちゃ！//今度も、負けませんよ！", "pointer_offset": 4344, "unit": "dialogue:784c61a9a503e3ca", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0022", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5370, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "fbf4f0e2f1f7f94bf1e2f1d5f0ef81b82f2ff14af184f0a5f246f0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "또 대전해 주세요∈//수고하셨습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "また対戦してくださいね！//お疲れさまでした。", "pointer_offset": 4348, "unit": "dialogue:75dd0c8335cc6149", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0023", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5415, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f2cef4552f2ff0b2f3bbf15af0ef8144", "baseline_text": "후훗//이겼어요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふふっ//勝っちゃいました。", "pointer_offset": 4352, "unit": "dialogue:be7d109d68b73f6b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0024", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5442, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0aff7d12f2ff9d0f26cf35df0f0f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "하아…//져 버렸네요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はぁ……//負けちゃいましたか……", "pointer_offset": 4356, "unit": "dialogue:f54b6e947111b8e4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
