{"id": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN#0026", "file": "MINIGAME/JT00SAKU.SBN", "offset": 5498, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f2cef1adf7d1f16bf2d5f293f0d3f144f0ef81482f2ff2d5f293f957f0b1f8a4f287f2e9f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff1c3f1c8f3d2f0a2f0b8f2618143f273f274f29ef25281b8", "baseline_text": "후우…무승부인가요？//승부는 나지 않았지만…//즐거웠으니까，괜찮겠죠∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふぅ……引き分けですか。//勝負はつきませんでしたけど……//楽しかったから、いいですよね！", "pointer_offset": 4364, "unit": "dialogue:1c5dc228b251f38e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
